  ("Return to a clean demo (maintainer only, testers skip this)", "**Maintainer only.** Testers cannot run this and should mark it Skip. To get a clean demo before a run, the maintainer runs the unseed command, then the seed command, then the media refresh (see the release runbook in the Fayda repo, `infra/README.md`). The seed makes plain gradient pictures; `node infra/seed/refresh-demo-media.mjs <api-url> --yes` puts the illustrated pictures and 60-second reels back.", "Demo data is back to the clean state, with pictures and reels."),
